80. PRACTICAL PROGRAM — TABLE
============================================================

Print multiplication table of n:

    int n;

    scanf("%d", &n);

    for (int i = 1; i <= 10; i++)
    {
        printf("%d x %d = %d\n",
               n, i, n * i);
