============================================================

    int arr[] = {10, 40, 20, 80, 30};
    int n = sizeof(arr) / sizeof(arr[0]);

    int max = arr[0];

    for (int i = 1; i < n; i++)
    {
        if (arr[i] > max)
        {
            max = arr[i];
        }
    }

    printf("Max = %d\n", max);


This combines:

    array
    loop
    condition


