100. FINAL REVISION
============================================================

while:

    condition checked first.

    while (condition)
    {
        ...
    }


do-while:

    body executes first.

    do
    {
        ...
    }
    while (condition);


for:

    initialization
    condition
    update

    for (initialization; condition; update)
    {
        ...
    }


break:

    exits nearest loop/switch.


continue:

    skips current iteration.


Nested loop:

    loop inside another loop.


Counter loop:

    fixed/reasonably predictable number of iterations.


Sentinel loop:

    terminates when special value appears.


Off-by-one:

    one extra or one missing iteration.


Complexity:

    One loop       → O(n)
    Nested loops   → O(n²)
    Doubling       → O(log n)
    Nested + log   → O(n log n)


